				"content": "A month grid that drops each task onto a single day — the day named by one\ndate field, chosen with the **Due / Start** toggle in the toolbar. A task with\nno value in that field sits in the collapsible **Unscheduled** drawer until you\ndrag it onto a day.\n\nDrag a chip to another day to reschedule it: a task carrying both a start and a\ndue date keeps the gap between them, exactly like moving a Timeline bar. Click\nan empty spot in a day to create a task already dated to it. A day with more\ntasks than fit shows **+N more**, which opens the rest in a popover.\n\nPrev / next month and **Today** just page the grid — they never count as\nunsaved changes. The date-field toggle does change what the view shows, so it\nsaves like grouping or sort. Projects don't appear on the Calendar."
